        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive this stealth mascot horror, Try to hide and sneak around while Wavey patrols the car lot. Use the document provided by the dealer to search for cars with the Items to create your escape. Multiple endings, random gen, and comedic narration. Wavey is much more than a flailing tarp.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Wavey's East Automall</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wavey's East Automall is a <strong>stealth mascot style horror game</strong> where <strong>Milo Price the owner </strong>will make <strong>Comedic Narration</strong> on your every objective. Don't listen to him he is in a group of the most evil conniving people on the planet....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USED CAR SALESMEN!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Car Lot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire dealership lot is <strong>randomly generated </strong>with cars and items to<strong> make your escape. </strong>your friend has been kidnapped and is hidden somewhere on the lot . You can decide if they are important enough to <strong>risk your life for</strong>. You will need to cover ground fast and confidently as <strong>Wavey</strong> will be <strong>alerted</strong> while you search, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make sure to <strong>turn off your flashlight! </strong>hey, I warned ya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.poster.avif?t=1763928545\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.webm?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.mp4?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack Opening Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DO YOU LIKE <strong>OPENING PACKS!!! </strong>Well you can do it at Wavey's East Automall, but not with cards or stickers. <br><strong>AIR FRESHNERS!!!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do these help you in your quest to save your friend... I don't really know.. but are they fun, uh <strong>YEAH</strong>. Collect all the <strong>airfreshners</strong> in the game, and plan for more to be added for the <strong>holidays</strong> coming up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.poster.avif?t=1763928545\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.webm?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.mp4?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wavey's East Automall</strong> was one of the first company's to adopt the tube man as a marketing stunt. <strong>It worked.</strong> For decades Wavey would wave like that of a metronome with no end in sight. As time went on something changed, people <strong>stopped waving back.</strong> was the idea getting old, was Wavey getting old. In this game you will be dragged into this story unwillingly, <strong>Wavey is looking for the affection he used to receive, someone to wave back.. </strong>And all this neglect after all this work has built some sort of a hunger for attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/5e4162d6b437a2bbd6108df598e8bb7d.avif?t=1763928545\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive this stealth mascot horror, Try to hide and sneak around while Wavey patrols the car lot. Use the document provided by the dealer to search for cars with the Items to create your escape. Multiple endings, random gen, and comedic narration. Wavey is much more than a flailing tarp.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Wavey's East Automall</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wavey's East Automall is a <strong>stealth mascot style horror game</strong> where <strong>Milo Price the owner </strong>will make <strong>Comedic Narration</strong> on your every objective. Don't listen to him he is in a group of the most evil conniving people on the planet....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USED CAR SALESMEN!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Car Lot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire dealership lot is <strong>randomly generated </strong>with cars and items to<strong> make your escape. </strong>your friend has been kidnapped and is hidden somewhere on the lot . You can decide if they are important enough to <strong>risk your life for</strong>. You will need to cover ground fast and confidently as <strong>Wavey</strong> will be <strong>alerted</strong> while you search, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make sure to <strong>turn off your flashlight! </strong>hey, I warned ya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.poster.avif?t=1763928545\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.webm?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/acec2888020ae45072edf8bfcae3e574.mp4?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack Opening Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DO YOU LIKE <strong>OPENING PACKS!!! </strong>Well you can do it at Wavey's East Automall, but not with cards or stickers. <br><strong>AIR FRESHNERS!!!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do these help you in your quest to save your friend... I don't really know.. but are they fun, uh <strong>YEAH</strong>. Collect all the <strong>airfreshners</strong> in the game, and plan for more to be added for the <strong>holidays</strong> coming up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.poster.avif?t=1763928545\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.webm?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/d957f5b09e11ff8b277f00353e502798.mp4?t=1763928545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wavey's East Automall</strong> was one of the first company's to adopt the tube man as a marketing stunt. <strong>It worked.</strong> For decades Wavey would wave like that of a metronome with no end in sight. As time went on something changed, people <strong>stopped waving back.</strong> was the idea getting old, was Wavey getting old. In this game you will be dragged into this story unwillingly, <strong>Wavey is looking for the affection he used to receive, someone to wave back.. </strong>And all this neglect after all this work has built some sort of a hunger for attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047410/extras/5e4162d6b437a2bbd6108df598e8bb7d.avif?t=1763928545\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p>",
